# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# ReelKeep – what stays out of the repository.
# Source, assets (fonts, icons), build scripts and docs are committed; everything below is generated, downloaded
# at runtime, personal, or too big. The released exe is attached to GitHub Releases, never committed.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Build output
bin/
obj/
dist/
publish/
artifacts/
TestResults/
*.pdb
*.nupkg

# Any compiled or downloaded executables (ReelKeep.exe, yt-dlp.exe, ffmpeg.exe, ffprobe.exe, ...)
*.exe
*.dll
*.zip
*.7z

# IDE / editor settings
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
*.user
*.suo
*.swp
*.DotSettings.user

# OS clutter
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store

# Media and library data (if a library folder is ever pointed inside the repo)
.library/
*.mp4
*.mkv
*.webm
*.mov
*.avi
*.m4a
*.mp3
*.opus
*.ogg
*.flac
*.wav
*.part
*.ytdl
*.info.json

# Logs and local app data
*.log
error.log
settings.json
